title: A program changes a file of the shared folder on a reader's disk: nothing reaches the host, and the reader's card shows the host's text again once the host changes that file (until then it shows the local change: look at the pictures)
folders: share-text
limit: 75
expect-log: share: share-text is shared, 4 files
expect-file: share-text\other.txt :: ^alpha\nbeta\ngamma\nhost-line\n$

wait 3000
share start
wait 16000
touch other.txt host-line
wait 9000
quit
wait 800
answer Close without saving
wait 1000
=== guest
wait 2500
share join {INVITE} Beto
wait 4000
goto other.txt
wait 1200
touch other.txt changed-on-the-readers-disk
wait 4000
mark after-local-change
wait 7000
mark after-the-host-changed-it
wait 3000
quit
wait 1500
